    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915900/extras/21ce0e4b3991dc5e049629ec2f2d1ca0.poster.avif?t=1730481427\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915900/extras/21ce0e4b3991dc5e049629ec2f2d1ca0.webm?t=1730481427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915900/extras/21ce0e4b3991dc5e049629ec2f2d1ca0.mp4?t=1730481427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;Hew Many Foemen&quot;, a roguelite hack and slash challenging you to conquer islands of Norrw\u00f8y.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the sea and conquer the archipelago. Face formidable foes and grow stronger with each victorious battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Hugr Seeds from your fallen enemies, the essence of warrior's strength. Use them to tactically unleash powerful skills or save them up to permanently upgrade your warrior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hew Many Foemen takes inspiration from genre classics like and blends them into a fast paced but tactical satisfying gameplay loop, where you can hop in for instant fun anytime. Begin your saga now. Ascend as a timeless hero.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915900/extras/21ce0e4b3991dc5e049629ec2f2d1ca0.poster.avif?t=1730481427\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915900/extras/21ce0e4b3991dc5e049629ec2f2d1ca0.webm?t=1730481427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915900/extras/21ce0e4b3991dc5e049629ec2f2d1ca0.mp4?t=1730481427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;Hew Many Foemen&quot;, a roguelite hack and slash challenging you to conquer islands of Norrw\u00f8y.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the sea and conquer the archipelago. Face formidable foes and grow stronger with each victorious battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Hugr Seeds from your fallen enemies, the essence of warrior's strength. Use them to tactically unleash powerful skills or save them up to permanently upgrade your warrior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hew Many Foemen takes inspiration from genre classics like and blends them into a fast paced but tactical satisfying gameplay loop, where you can hop in for instant fun anytime. Begin your saga now. Ascend as a timeless hero.</p>",
    "short_description": "Unleash your inner warrior in this unique roguelite odyssey. Conquer islands in fast-paced hack'n'slash adventure, use your skills tactically and hew your enemies!",
